            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Available device accessibility preferences are used until changed here. Screen reader speech speed and voice volume use PlayStation defaults.\n\nRequests these settings for the PlayStation cloud console at the next stream launch."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在更改此处设置之前，将使用设备现有的辅助功能偏好。屏幕朗读的语速和音量使用 PlayStation 默认值。\n\n下次启动串流时会向 PlayStation 云主机请求这些设置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
